  },
  {
    q: "How fast does the on-call tech get a no-heat call?",
    a: "The dispatch goes out within 60 seconds of a call matching an emergency rule you approved. It carries the caller's name, callback number, address, and the problem the triage questions captured. That is the page going out, not a promise the tech picked up. If they do not accept, the backup you named is next. If nobody accepts, the manager you named gets the same facts.",
